rancher_deploy_server calls install_cilium unconditionally (Rancher.pm step 7), but cilium => 0 makes install_server keep the bundled CNI (Canal on rke2, Flannel on k3s). Result: Cilium is installed on top of Canal/Flannel. POD of the cilium option says it keeps the built-in CNI. Fix: skip install_cilium when cilium is false; decide whether gateway_api with cilium => 0 dies. Found while working k14, not changed there.

